  "description": "Dremel 932 Aluminium Oxide Grinding Stone - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Dremel 932 Aluminium Oxide Grinding Stone - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Dremel 932 Aluminium Oxide Grinding Stone - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Product DescriptionDremel 932 Aluminum Oxide Grinding Stone.From the ManufacturerA high-quality industrial abrasive made for extended use; this Dremel grinding stone features a 1/8\" shank, and is ideal for sharpening, deburring and general purpose grinding. Made with aluminum oxide, this Dremel is tough enough to smooth out most materials including stainless steel. The Dremel 932 is specially designed to grind flat and slotted surfaces. It has plenty of shank for the collet or chuck to hold onto for proper attaching. And, this durable, grinding stone can be cleaned and restored to its original shape after extended use, longer tool life and more efficient grinding.FEATURESHigh-quality industrial abrasive for removing burrs and general grindingSpecially designed for working with flat and slotted surfacesPlenty of shank for the collet or chuck to hold ontoCan be cleaned and restored to original shape after extended use30,000 rpm maximum for fast grinding and deburringSPECIFICATIONSShank: 1/8\" (3,2mm)Maximum RPM: 30,000",
